        }
      ],
      "extract": "Generalized Markov traces and Jucys-Murphy elements Kostiantyn Tolmachov, Heorhii Zhylinskyi Abstract We give a simple construction of Markov traces for Iwahori-Hecke algebras associated with infinite series of crystallographic Coxeter groups. In types B and D it is new, and generalizes a known construction in type A employing symmetric polynomials in multiplicative Jucys-Murphy elements.",
      "extractCut": false,
      "blocks": [
        "library/arxiv-2507.19896v1/blocks/prose-sec-front-matter"
      ]
    },
    {
