      "extract": "The results of this paper were obtained while the authors participated in \\href{https://math.mit.edu/research/highschool/primes/YuliasDream/}{Yulia's Dream} program. We would like to thank the program's or\\-ga\\-ni\\-zers for this wonderful initiative. We would like to thank Mykhailo Barkulov, another participant of the program, for helpful discussions. We have conducted numerical experiments using SageMath software",
